{"id":"2ac3d596368e32ad","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-display-correspondence.md","title":"display map 的理解结构","display":"df-display-correspondence — display map 的理解结构","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","label":"16-df-display-correspondence","aliases":["16-df-display-correspondence","Display/comprehension correspondence"],"display":"df-display-correspondence — display map 的理解结构","depends_on":["[[16-df-display-fibration]]","[[16-df-full-comprehension]]"],"source":"Definition 10.4.2 and Corollary 10.4.5, pp. 613–615 (PDF 633–635)","revision_date":"2026-10-07"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-display-correspondence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-display-correspondence</span><span>Display/comprehension correspondence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-display-correspondence — display map 的理解结构"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"53dadf7eff1efeea\" href=\"?note=53dadf7eff1efeea\" title=\"16-df-display-fibration\">16-df-display-fibration</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"dfea0d23e394e93b\" href=\"?note=dfea0d23e394e93b\" title=\"16-df-full-comprehension\">16-df-full-comprehension</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Definition 10.4.2 and Corollary 10.4.5, pp. 613–615 (PDF 633–635)"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-07"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"53dadf7eff1efeea\" href=\"?note=53dadf7eff1efeea\" title=\"16-df-display-fibration\">16-df-display-fibration</a> 中的拉回稳定态射类，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota_D:\\mathbf D\\hookrightarrow\\mathcal B^{\\to}\">\\(\\iota_D:\\mathbf D\\hookrightarrow\\mathcal B^{\\to}\\)</span> 为满包含。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DisplayCorr}\">\\(\\mathrm{DisplayCorr}\\)</span> 为本原子定义的记号，其结构参数与完整条件在下文给出。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FullComp}\">\\(\\mathrm{FullComp}\\)</span> 的定义及结构参数见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"dfea0d23e394e93b\" href=\"?note=dfea0d23e394e93b\" title=\"16-df-full-comprehension\">16-df-full-comprehension</a>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}display\\text{-}correspondence}\\vdash\\quad \\mathrm{DisplayCorr}(\\mathcal B,D)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{FullComp}(\\operatorname{cod}_D,\\iota_D).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}display\\text{-}correspondence}\\vdash\\quad \\mathrm{DisplayCorr}(\\mathcal B,D)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{FullComp}(\\operatorname{cod}_D,\\iota_D).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>每个这样的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span> 都满足右侧：包含函子满忠实，并把余域笛卡尔箭头送到拉回。</li>\n<li>反向取理解投影的垂直同构闭包；在满理解假设下，总范畴与相应 display-map 范畴等价，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"75a4c54baaa666ef\" href=\"?note=75a4c54baaa666ef\" title=\"16-thm-display-correspondence\">16-thm-display-correspondence</a>。</li>\n<li>来源：Jacobs, <em>Categorical Logic and Type Theory</em>，Definition 10.4.2 and Corollary 10.4.5, pp. 613–615 (PDF 633–635)。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-display-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"53dadf7eff1efeea","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-display-fibration]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-full-comprehension","status":"resolved","id":"dfea0d23e394e93b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-full-comprehension]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-display-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"53dadf7eff1efeea","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$D$ 是 [[16-df-display-fibration]] 中的拉回稳定态射类，$\\iota_D:\\mathbf D\\hookrightarrow\\mathcal B^{\\to}$ 为满包含。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-full-comprehension","status":"resolved","id":"dfea0d23e394e93b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FullComp}$ 的定义及结构参数见 [[16-df-full-comprehension]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-thm-display-correspondence","status":"resolved","id":"75a4c54baaa666ef","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"反向取理解投影的垂直同构闭包；在满理解假设下，总范畴与相应 display-map 范畴等价，见 [[16-thm-display-correspondence]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"D","display":false},{"tex":"\\iota_D:\\mathbf D\\hookrightarrow\\mathcal B^{\\to}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DisplayCorr}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FullComp}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}display\\text{-}correspondence}\\vdash\\quad \\mathrm{DisplayCorr}(\\mathcal B,D)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{FullComp}(\\operatorname{cod}_D,\\iota_D).","display":true},{"tex":"D","display":false}],"bytes":1452,"backlinks":[{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-182","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[16-df-display-correspondence|df-display-correspondence — display map 的理解结构]]"}],"outgoing":["53dadf7eff1efeea","dfea0d23e394e93b","75a4c54baaa666ef"]}